{"4277610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Canyon Raid", "steam_appid": 4277610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Classic Reborn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember River Raid? Canyon Raid is a modern recration of the 1982 classic into vibrant 3D with roguelike mechanics. Fly your aircraft through procedurally generated canyons, destroy ships and enemy planes, evade incoming fire, and demolish bridges blocking your path—all rendered in a beautiful low-poly art style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>River Raid on Steroids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a remake—it's an evolution. Canyon Raid builds on the addictive simplicity of the original while introducing deep progression systems designed for modern players:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Aircraft</strong> Choose from various aircraft, each with unique handling, weapons, and playstyles. Find the one that matches your strategy.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/35f41b143dc335aebc5d386896b787d3.poster.avif?t=1786622880\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/35f41b143dc335aebc5d386896b787d3.webm?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/35f41b143dc335aebc5d386896b787d3.mp4?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Permanent Unlocks:</strong> Progress through runs to permanently unlock new aircraft and upgrades (roguelike meta-progression)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/a7d37c6e7fc9992c839cac8576879862.poster.avif?t=1786622880\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/a7d37c6e7fc9992c839cac8576879862.webm?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/a7d37c6e7fc9992c839cac8576879862.mp4?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Run Upgrades:</strong> Destroy enemies, collect XP, and choose from tiered upgrades (1-5 tiers) during each flight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/b7b2a53a323c9aec221bbc2381480248.poster.avif?t=1786622880\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/b7b2a53a323c9aec221bbc2381480248.webm?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/b7b2a53a323c9aec221bbc2381480248.mp4?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> Procedurally generated levels mean no two runs are the same. Unlike the original's static patterns, enemies and obstacles are generated dynamically based on how far you've flown.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/46d5e6a8c9eb6ede445910689effd8bd.poster.avif?t=1786622880\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/46d5e6a8c9eb6ede445910689effd8bd.webm?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/46d5e6a8c9eb6ede445910689effd8bd.mp4?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern 3D reimagining of the 1982 classic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible gameplay with deep strategic progression </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels for infinite variety </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiered upgrade system with varied probabilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements, leaderboards, and cloud saves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized low-poly aesthetics blending retro charm with modern appeal</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Vision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/18aedaade2c369a1d606b0fb270c5372.poster.avif?t=1786622880\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/18aedaade2c369a1d606b0fb270c5372.webm?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277610/extras/18aedaade2c369a1d606b0fb270c5372.mp4?t=1786622880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canyon Raid was born from a passion for classic gaming and a desire to see how timeless gameplay could evolve with modern mechanics. Every system—from the upgrade trees to the procedural generation—has been crafted to honor the original while delivering something fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take to the skies. Mast